"Test %d failed.\\n\", test);\n            return 1;\n        }\n\n        printf(\"Test %d passed. All closed syncmers match between original and naive method.\\n\\n\", test);\n    }\n\n    printf(\"All tests passed.\\n\");\n    return 0;\n}\n","numLines":96,"startLine":1,"totalLines":96}}}
